    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Colleran Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale Apartment 4, Coill Mhara, Cappagh Road, Galway, a bright, ground floor, two-bedroom apartment in a convenient and well-established residential location.\n\nThis apartment offers well-proportioned accommodation with a particularly bright open-plan sitting, dining and kitchen area. A large southwest-facing window floods the living space with natural light, while the adjoining kitchen is fitted with a generous range of built-in units.\n\nThere are two generously sized bedrooms, both with built-in wardrobes, with the main bedroom also benefiting from a fully tiled ensuite. A separate main bathroom completes the accommodation.\n\nA further and particularly valuable feature of Apartment 4 is the inclusion of two allocated car parking spaces, making it an appealing option for first-time buyers, investors or those looking for a convenient Galway base. A large, landscaped, communal garden extends lovely outdoor space to all residents.\n\nSituated on Cappagh Road, the property is well positioned for easy access to the wonderful Cappagh Park and Barna Woods providing excellent recreational facilities on your doorstep, while Salthill Promenade, Barna and Galway city centre are all within easy reach.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: - 4.3m (14'1\") x 1.5m (4'11\")\nWith tiled floor and hot press.\n\nOpen Plan Sitting/Kitchen/Dining Room:\n\nLiving/Dining Area: - 4.7m (15'5\") x 4.3m (14'1\")\nThe living/dining area has a large southwest facing window filling the room with natural light. Tiled floor.\n\nKitchen Area: - 2.6m (8'6\") x 2.3m (7'7\")\nThe Kitchen area has a generous range of built-in kitchen units. Tiled floor.\n\nMain Bedroom: - 5m (16'5\") x 2.6m (8'6\")\nWith attractive laminate floor and built-in wardrobe. \nEnsuite (2.6m x 1.2m) fully tiled and fitted with electric shower, toilet and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom 2: - 4m (13'1\") x 2.6m (8'6\")\nWith built-in wardrobe.\n\nBathroom: - 2m (6'7\") x 1.5m (4'11\")\nFully tiled and fitted with bath, toilet & wash hand basin.\n\nParking:\nThere are two allocated car parking spaces.\n\nManagement Fee:\n1,600 per annum (Galway Property Management Co.)\n\nArea\n67.15 sqm/ 722.79 sqft approximately\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Bright, ground floor, two-bedroom apartment in a convenient Cappagh Road location </li><li> Southwest-facing open-plan living area enjoying excellent natural light </li><li> Two generous bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, main bedroom ensuite </li><li> Two allocated car parking spaces and large landscaped communal garden</li></ul>"
